  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, stay transparent for the audit, and coordinate the recall and refund process."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All bread from this week's batch is being recalled; no sales today. Refunds will be issued at the co‑op; please do not eat any co‑op bread until we confirm it's safe.",
  "coop_message": "Team, initiate a full recall of today's loaves, discard the contaminated stock, process refunds for any purchases, and prepare a safety report for the council; we will source new flour and aim to resume baking tomorrow.",
